# Backend base URL.
#
# You normally need NOTHING here. `vite dev` picks up .env.development, and a
# production build intentionally has no VITE_API_URL so the bundle talks to
# whatever origin served it — which is how the single-container deployment
# works without CORS.
#
# Set this only for a SPLIT deployment, where the UI and API are on different
# origins; the backend's FRONTEND_URL must then list this UI's origin.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.up.railway.app
